# Firmum Model Gate

Use the **lowest gate that can do the current task well**. Do not burn GPT-5.5, Codex, or Claude on G0 work. Never go *below* the minimum gate. Going *above* is fine if the user is already on that model and says stay.

**Never use Grok** unless the user names Grok in that message. Do not substitute Grok when a requested model is unavailable — say so and stay on Composer.

## Gates

| Gate | Use this model | Typical work |
|------|----------------|--------------|
| **G0** | Composer 2.5 Fast | Routes, copy, shells, lint, `appUrl`, wiring |
| **G1** | GPT-5.5 Medium (fallback: GPT-5.6 Sol Medium) | CRUD APIs, React pages, onboarding UI |
| **G2** | GPT-5.3 Codex | StatementService, migrations, multi-file backend |
| **G3** | Claude Sonnet/Opus thinking | Auth unify, IDOR/scopes, compliance prompts |
| **G4** | Human | Prod Postgres, Alembic on live DB, deploy, legal |

