## At a gate boundary

Stop. Do not continue the next-gate task on the cheaper model. End with:

```
## MODEL SWITCH REQUIRED → [Model]

[What just finished]. Next is [task IDs]. Switch the Agent picker to **[Model]**, then paste:

[one-paragraph resume prompt]
```

User can override with "stay on this model."

## Subagents

Default subagent model: Composer (`composer-2.5-fast` or newer). Only pass GPT/Claude/Codex when the delegated task’s min gate is G1+.
